# Clock and video output. PDF page 3, printed page 1, block T.
# Written like a MAME netlist: chips by location, then each wire as the pins it joins.
# tools/generate_netlist.py names the Verilog wires from the pins: docs/NET_NAMES.md.
# NC marks a drawn output stub. Unlisted inputs remain unknown.
# Clock input 1TQ14 replaces B16 crystal oscillator at its pin 6.
# T999 and T998 are external power-up/analog boundary signals, not forced resets.
chip B16 7404
chip G15 7404
chip C16 74112
chip E14 7400
chip D16 7437
chip A15 74161
chip B15 74161
prom C15 82S123 31
chip E15 7411
chip D15 7402
chip F15 7432
chip E16 7408
chip F14 7437
chip A14 74161
chip B14 74161
chip D14 74112
prom C14 82S123 32
chip G14 7421
chip H14 7421
chip J14 7437
# Fixed 2026-11-05: pin 9 reads TLCB on this drawing and Death Race 8B.
chip A13 7408
chip F16 74174

# Wires: drawing label, then every pin it joins on this sheet. BOARD marks a
# wire that rtl/deathrac_board.v drives or reads. GND/VCC are tied pins, OPEN a
# visibly floating input, NC a drawn output stub that goes nowhere.
net 5TECB B16.10 B15.9
net TECB B16.11 B15.15 C16.12 C16.11 E15.5
net 5TEC3 B16.12
net TEC3 B16.13 A15.12 BOARD
net 5TLCB G15.2 B14.9
net TLCB G15.1 B14.15 D14.2 D14.3 A13.9
net 1THVA G15.6
net 5THVA G15.5 D15.10
net 5TNVD G15.8 BOARD
net TNVD G15.9 F16.10
net 6TCSC G15.10
net 1TCSC G15.11 F16.12
net 1TBVD G15.12 BOARD
net 5TBVD G15.13 F16.15
net 1TQ14 C16.1 E14.5 BOARD
net T999 C16.2 C16.3 C16.4 C16.15 A15.1 A15.7 A15.9 A15.10 B15.1 C16.10 C16.14 F16.1 BOARD
net NC C16.5 C14.1 C14.2
net C16_6 C16.6 E14.4
net 5TQ07 E14.6 D16.1 D16.2
net 1TQ07 D16.3 D16.4 D16.5 D16.12 F14.4 F14.10 F14.13
net 6TQ07 D16.6 D16.9 D16.10 A15.2 B15.2 F16.9 BOARD
net 2TQ07 D16.8 C16.13
net TEC4 A15.11 BOARD
net TEC2 A15.13 BOARD
net TEC1 A15.14 BOARD
net TECA A15.15 B15.7 B15.10 E15.10 E16.4 G14.1 G14.13 H14.1
net GND B15.3 B15.6 C15.15 B14.3 C14.15
net 5TEC9 B15.4 B15.5 C16.7 A13.10
net TEC8 B15.11 C15.13 BOARD
net TEC7 B15.12 C15.12 BOARD
net TEC6 B15.13 C15.11 BOARD
net TEC5 B15.14 C15.10 BOARD
net TEC9 C16.9 C15.14 D15.9 BOARD
net 5TVRL C15.1
net TCRG C15.2
net TSS0 C15.3
net TSS1 C15.4
net TELG C15.5 E16.5 G14.2 G14.12 H14.2
net THSC C15.6 F15.4 BOARD
net TSLG C15.7 E15.9
net THBL C15.9 D15.2 BOARD
net TDLN E15.6 F16.3
net TVLG E15.3 E15.11 C14.7
net TLC2 E15.4 A14.13 BOARD
net TSLN E15.8 F16.6
net 5TCBG D15.1 F15.2
net TLC9 D15.3 D14.5 D14.13 C14.14 BOARD
net 5TCBL F15.3
net 1TSLN F15.1 F15.9 F16.7
net TVSC E16.3 F15.5 BOARD
net TVGY E16.1 C14.4 G14.9
net TVSG E16.2 D15.4
net TCSC F15.6 F16.13
net TGLC E16.6 D16.13
net 6TQLC D16.11 F14.1 F14.2 A14.2 B14.2
net 2TQLC F14.3 D14.1
net T998 A14.1 A14.7 A14.9 A14.10 B14.1 D14.4 D14.15 D14.12 D14.11 D14.10 D14.14 BOARD
net TLC4 A14.11 D15.5 BOARD
net TLC3 A14.12 D15.6 BOARD
net TLC1 A14.14 BOARD
net TLCA A14.15 B14.7 B14.10 E16.9 G14.4 G14.10 H14.4
net 5TLC9 B14.4 B14.5 B14.6 D14.6
net TLC8 B14.11 C14.13 BOARD
net TLC7 B14.12 C14.12 BOARD
net TLC6 B14.13 C14.11 BOARD
net TLC5 B14.14 C14.10 BOARD
net TLC0 D14.9 E14.1
net 5TLC0 D14.7
net TVGZ C14.3 H14.5
net TVGX C14.5 G14.5
net TVGA C14.6 D15.8
net THLG C14.9 E16.10
net 5TFGY E14.3
net TLGY E14.2 G14.8 F14.9
net THLM E16.8 F15.10
net TLNA F15.8 D15.11
net 5TLHB D15.13
net 2TDLN D15.12 F16.5
net TLGX G14.6 F14.5
net TLGZ H14.6 F14.12
net 6TQGX F14.6 J14.1 J14.2
net 6TQGY F14.8
net 6TQGZ F14.11 J14.4 J14.5
net 2TQGX J14.3
net 2TQGZ J14.6
net TDAM A13.8
net 1TDLN F16.4 F16.2
net 1PNVD F16.11
net 5PV1B F16.14
